## 📂 Dataset

The project uses a sales dataset containing information related to:

- Sales transactions and order details
- Customers and geographic locations
- Products, categories and subcategories
- Sales territories and regions
- Order and shipping dates
- Sales amounts, quantities and product costs

The data was modelled in Power BI to support analysis across sales, customers, products and regional performance.

> **Note:** The original dataset is not included in this repository as it was provided for an assessment. This repository focuses on demonstrating my Power BI, DAX, data modelling and analytical skills.

## 🧮 Data Modelling & DAX

The Power BI model connects sales data with customer, product, date and sales territory dimensions to support interactive analysis.

Key DAX calculations include:

- Total Sales
- Total Orders
- Total Quantity
- Gross Profit
- Profit Margin %
- Average Shipping Days
- Sales Previous Year
- YoY Sales Change %
- Customer Sales Ranking
- Total Customers
- Average Sales per Customer
